text.section:
Any dredging plan required to be submitted with an application shall include the following information:

Geotechnical analysis of the proposed area to be dredged;


Analysis of the benthic, marine, and fishery resources, including a specific analysis of the impact on the crab population;


Current recreational and commercial fishing activity in the proposed dredge area;


Impact on any historical artifacts in the proposed dredge area;


Impact on other uses of the state waters and bottomlands at the dredge site;


Location of the beach areas to be replenished; and


Environmental impact of the dredge material being placed on the beach area.
